  cat <<'EOF'
pack send - create and send a sync pack via Telegram

Usage:
  pack [pack options] send [send options]
  pack send setup
  pack [pack options] send [send options] doctor

Configuration:
  Uses the global conf.toml in the sync_tool directory.
  Pack settings live in [pack].
  Telegram target for send lives in [pack.send.telegram].
  Shared Telegram auth/proxy lives in [telegram.common].

Pack options:
  --output-dir PATH
  --pack-prefix PREFIX
  --machine-name NAME
  --remote NAME
  -u, --update [N]
  --branch NAME
  --branches LIST
  --with-tags 0|1
  --dry-run

Send options:
  --api-id ID
  --api-hash HASH
  --session PATH
  --to PEER
  --ack-scan-limit N
  --proxy-type none|socks5|http|mtproto
  --socks5-host HOST --socks5-port PORT [--socks5-user USER] [--socks5-password PASS]
